D:\UniPi\Semester 1\420AA Data Mining\Project DM2\Data-Mining-2-2026->      "--- VARIANZA SPIEGATA DALLE COMPONENTI ---\n",

D:\UniPi\Semester 1\420AA Data Mining\Project DM2\Data-Mining-2-2026->      "Componente 1: 10.63%\n",

D:\UniPi\Semester 1\420AA Data Mining\Project DM2\Data-Mining-2-2026->      "Componente 2: 8.25%\n",

D:\UniPi\Semester 1\420AA Data Mining\Project DM2\Data-Mining-2-2026->      "Componente 3: 5.31%\n",

