D:\UniPi\Semester 1\420AA Data Mining\Project DM2\Data-Mining-2-2026->    "Given that we have not chosen the outliers only based on one algorithm which could have falsly classified a point as outlier based on the limitation of that particular algorithm, and instead we have identified the 76 outlier points from the intersection of the results of diverse outlier detection algorithms, we have decided to remove these data points from our analysis."

